cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If this skill helped your writing, please cite this repository."
title: "Embodied AI Paper Writer: A portable agent skill for crafting top-conference robotics papers"
abstract: >
  A portable agent skill (SKILL.md + reference playbooks) distilled from 63
  top-conference papers across CoRL, RSS, ICRA, IROS, and Science Robotics
  (2022–2026), covering writing craft only: vocabulary, sentence patterns,
  paragraph flow, figure/table conventions, section-by-section construction,
  rhetorical pivots, and appendix norms. Works with any LLM agent that can
  load markdown context. Built using the Nuwa skill-distillation methodology.
authors:
